    "title": "HCPS School Board approves revisions to policy regarding Staff Weapons in Schools - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carolynn Unger ,\n19 hours ago HARRISONBURG, VA (Rocktown Now) — The Harrisonburg City School Board approved revised Policy 666 regarding Staff Weapons in Schools. Administrator Kelly Lineweaver said the revision was made due to the language being confusing and worked with the Virginia School Boards Association to revise and reissue the policy for the state. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
